            <p>United leverages its San Francisco hub and Star Alliance partnerships for London-bound traffic. </p>

            <p><b>Distinctive positioning:</b></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Connections through San Francisco (SFO) and Chicago O'Hare (ORD)</li>
                <li>MileagePlus earning with Lufthansa/Austrian/Swiss partnerships</li>
                <li>Polaris business class on long-haul segments</li>
                <li>Strong West Coast network facilitating San Diego connections</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Delta Air Lines</h3>
            <p>Delta routes San Diego passengers through its Atlanta and Salt Lake City hubs. </p>

            <p><b>Notable features:</b></p>
